            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thank you for your swift reply! I was indeed unsure to which module to relate this to.\n\nJust now tried the code provided above, which does something related, but not the same (maybe because of formatting).\nIt does not show the commit message, and to my weary eyes it's not visually clear which lines matches which blame, mainly because it is still a different window. This is why I feel that having it as virtual text would improve readability.",
